1
00:00:58,415 --> 00:01:01,665
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Just packed up a real money load,
and it's coming your way.</font>

2
00:01:01,752 --> 00:01:05,915
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Look for "Rodgers" on the truck's side.
Don't forget my share of the deal.</font>

3
00:03:55,927 --> 00:03:56,508
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Shit!</font>

4
00:04:37,845 --> 00:04:41,296
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Tuna on white, no crust, right?
- I don't know. How is it?</font>

5
00:04:41,974 --> 00:04:46,268
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Every day, for the last three weeks,
you've come here, asking how the tuna is.</font>

6
00:04:46,353 --> 00:04:50,102
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Now, it was crappy yesterday.
It was crappy the day before.</font>

7
00:04:50,190 --> 00:04:52,978
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">And guess what? It hasn't changed.</font>

8
00:04:53,611 --> 00:04:55,520
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- I'll have the tuna.
- No crust?</font>

9
00:04:55,613 --> 00:04:56,692
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">No crust.</font>

10
00:05:20,930 --> 00:05:22,044
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Thank you.</font>

11
00:06:09,103 --> 00:06:11,476
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Talk to me, Jesse.
This ain't working, brother.</font>

12
00:06:11,564 --> 00:06:14,186
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">It's your fuel map. It's got a nasty hole.</font>

13
00:06:14,609 --> 00:06:17,361
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- That's why you're unloading in third.
- Told you.</font>

14
00:06:17,445 --> 00:06:22,570
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I lengthen the injector pulse a millisecond.
Just tune the NOS timer, you'll run nines.</font>

15
00:06:30,417 --> 00:06:33,038
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">What's up with this fool?
Is he sandwich-crazy?</font>

16
00:06:33,128 --> 00:06:37,754
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- No. He ain't here for the food, dog.
- Chill out. He's slinging parts for Harry.</font>

17
00:06:37,841 --> 00:06:41,340
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- I know what he's slinging.
- He's trying to get in Mia's pants, dog.</font>

18
00:06:41,428 --> 00:06:43,670
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What's up, guys?
- How you doing, Mia?</font>

19
00:06:43,763 --> 00:06:45,922
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- How you living, girl?
- Hey!</font>

20
00:06:46,516 --> 00:06:48,924
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Hey, Dom. You want something to drink?</font>

21
00:06:59,946 --> 00:07:03,066
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- He's beautiful.
- I like his haircut.</font>

22
00:07:05,786 --> 00:07:06,817
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Vince!</font>

23
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:10,072
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What?
- Can I get you anything?</font>

24
00:07:11,833 --> 00:07:13,114
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You look good.</font>

25
00:07:17,297 --> 00:07:19,967
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Thanks a lot, Mia. See you tomorrow.
- Sure.</font>

26
00:07:22,886 --> 00:07:24,843
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Tomorrow?
- I love this part.</font>

27
00:07:29,601 --> 00:07:34,228
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Try Fatburger from now on. Get yourself a
Double Cheese with fries for $2.95, faggot.</font>

28
00:07:34,314 --> 00:07:37,814
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- I like the tuna here.
- Bullshit. No one likes the tuna here.</font>

29
00:07:37,901 --> 00:07:39,312
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yeah, well, I do.</font>

30
00:07:51,832 --> 00:07:55,367
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Jesus Christ, Dom! Would you get out
there? I'm sick of this shit.</font>

31
00:07:55,461 --> 00:07:57,786
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I'm not kidding, Dom. Get out there!</font>

32
00:08:02,176 --> 00:08:04,667
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What did you put in that sandwich?
- That's funny.</font>

33
00:08:04,762 --> 00:08:06,968
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Dom!
- All right.</font>

34
00:08:25,491 --> 00:08:28,362
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Hey, man. He was in my face.
- I'm in your face.</font>

35
00:08:29,996 --> 00:08:32,913
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Relax! Don't push it! You embarrass me!</font>

36
00:08:35,585 --> 00:08:36,865
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Get over there!</font>

37
00:08:38,379 --> 00:08:40,170
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Jesse, give me the wallet.</font>

38
00:08:43,050 --> 00:08:46,419
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">"Brian Earl Spilner."
Sounds like a serial killer name.</font>

39
00:08:46,554 --> 00:08:48,345
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Is that what you are?
- No, man.</font>

40
00:08:48,431 --> 00:08:50,388
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Don't come around here again.</font>

41
00:08:52,810 --> 00:08:54,719
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Hey, man. This is bullshit.</font>

42
00:08:55,772 --> 00:08:58,772
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- You work for Harry, right?
- Yeah. I just started.</font>

43
00:08:58,983 --> 00:09:00,525
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You were just fired.</font>

44
00:09:13,456 --> 00:09:16,576
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Hey, Dominic.
I appreciate what you did, in a big way.</font>

45
00:09:17,085 --> 00:09:18,579
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Dominic, I owe you.</font>

46
00:09:20,505 --> 00:09:25,048
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Brian, you're messing with my business.
When Dominic drives, he's golden.</font>

47
00:09:25,176 --> 00:09:29,803
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Kids pour in. They want everything he has.
Every performance part. They pay cash!</font>

48
00:09:30,348 --> 00:09:33,100
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What did Dominic say?
- You don't want to know.</font>

49
00:09:33,435 --> 00:09:36,305
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What did Dominic say?
- He wants you out of here.</font>

50
00:09:36,896 --> 00:09:38,854
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- He wants me out of here?
- Yes.</font>

51
00:09:38,940 --> 00:09:42,226
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- And what did you say to Dom?
- What do you think I said?</font>

52
00:09:42,527 --> 00:09:45,018
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I told him, "Good help is hard to find."</font>

53
00:09:48,199 --> 00:09:49,231
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Relax.</font>

54
00:09:52,913 --> 00:09:54,158
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I need NOS.</font>

55
00:09:54,706 --> 00:09:56,912
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- I need NOS.
- No.</font>

56
00:09:57,083 --> 00:09:59,871
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">My car topped out at 140 miles per hour,
this morning.</font>

57
00:09:59,961 --> 00:10:04,374
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Amateurs don't use nitrous oxide. I've
seen how you drive. You've a heavy foot.</font>

58
00:10:05,175 --> 00:10:08,295
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- You'll blow yourself to pieces.
- I need one of these.</font>

59
00:10:08,553 --> 00:10:11,922
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">One of the big ones.
Actually, let's make it two.</font>

60
00:10:12,432 --> 00:10:14,591
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">And, Harry, I need it by tonight.</font>

61
00:11:26,382 --> 00:11:29,667
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Hold up, hold up.
Look at this snowman right here, man.</font>

62
00:11:34,014 --> 00:11:36,850
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Sweet ride.
What you running under there, man?</font>

63
00:11:39,603 --> 00:11:42,474
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Going to make me find out the hard way?
- Hell, yeah.</font>

64
00:11:42,565 --> 00:11:45,435
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You brave. You brave.
They call me Hector.</font>

65
00:11:46,068 --> 00:11:48,856
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I got a last name, too,
but I can't pronounce it.</font>

66
00:11:48,946 --> 00:11:51,402
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Brian Spilner.
- Typical white-boy name.</font>

67
00:11:51,741 --> 00:11:53,614
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Know what I'm saying?</font>

68
00:11:55,912 --> 00:12:00,787
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">See that over there? That's mine.
My baby. I ain't cutting her loose tonight.</font>

69
00:12:01,083 --> 00:12:02,910
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Why not?
- I'm going legit, homey.</font>

70
00:12:03,002 --> 00:12:05,671
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Trying to get on the NIRA circuit.
Heard about that?</font>

71
00:12:05,755 --> 00:12:08,756
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Hell, yeah.
- So, what's up with you, man?</font>

72
00:12:08,966 --> 00:12:13,130
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- I'm just waiting for Toretto.
- Shit. Better get in line. This yours?</font>

73
00:12:14,305 --> 00:12:16,796
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- I'm standing next to it.
- That's funny.</font>

74
00:12:16,933 --> 00:12:19,602
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You know,
Edwin happens to know a few things.</font>

75
00:12:21,771 --> 00:12:23,977
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">And one of the things Edwin knows is:
It's not how you stand by your car...</font>

76
00:12:24,399 --> 00:12:27,316
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">...it's how you race your car.
You better learn that.</font>

77
00:12:33,283 --> 00:12:36,200
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Oh, shit. Here they come. It's on.</font>

78
00:12:51,593 --> 00:12:53,384
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Dom.
- Marvin.</font>

79
00:12:55,096 --> 00:12:58,679
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Hey, Dom. How you doing?
- Hey, Camille. You been doing yoga?</font>

80
00:13:03,063 --> 00:13:05,980
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You did? Of course you did. Monica.</font>

81
00:13:08,860 --> 00:13:10,853
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I smell skanks.</font>

82
00:13:11,571 --> 00:13:15,439
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Why don't you girls pack it up,
before I leave tread marks on your face?</font>

83
00:13:15,534 --> 00:13:16,447
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Okay.</font>

84
00:13:16,701 --> 00:13:19,371
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Letty, I was just talking.
- Yeah. Whatever.</font>

85
00:13:19,788 --> 00:13:22,789
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Okay, Hector.
- Yeah? What's up, man?</font>

86
00:13:24,501 --> 00:13:26,043
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Yo. What's up?
- Edwin.</font>

87
00:13:26,128 --> 00:13:28,500
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- How we doing this tonight?
- One race.</font>

88
00:13:29,005 --> 00:13:33,134
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">$2,000 buy-in. Winner takes all.
Hector, you're going to hold the cash.</font>

89
00:13:33,635 --> 00:13:36,636
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Why Hector?
- Too slow to make away with the money.</font>

90
00:13:39,099 --> 00:13:41,768
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Okay. Good luck, guys.
- Hey, wait. Hold up.</font>

91
00:13:42,269 --> 00:13:46,136
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I don't have any cash.
But I do have the pink slip to my car.</font>

92
00:13:46,607 --> 00:13:50,439
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You just can't climb in the ring with Ali,
'cause you think you box.</font>

93
00:13:50,652 --> 00:13:53,902
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He knows I can box. Check it out.
It's like this.</font>

94
00:13:54,907 --> 00:13:58,026
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I lose, the winner takes my car.
Clean and clear.</font>

95
00:13:58,452 --> 00:14:01,821
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">But if I win, I take the cash,
and I take the respect.</font>

96
00:14:02,456 --> 00:14:03,487
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Respect.</font>

97
00:14:05,834 --> 00:14:08,206
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">To some people, that's more important.</font>

98
00:14:10,339 --> 00:14:11,667
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">That your car?</font>

99
00:14:15,469 --> 00:14:20,297
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I see a cool air intake. It's got a NOS
fogger system and a T 4 turbo, Dominic.</font>

100
00:14:20,474 --> 00:14:25,432
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I see an AIC controller.
It has direct port nitrous injection.</font>

101
00:14:25,688 --> 00:14:28,475
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yeah. And a stand-alone
fuel management system.</font>

102
00:14:29,483 --> 00:14:31,559
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Not a bad way to spend $10,000.</font>

103
00:14:34,572 --> 00:14:36,030
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You see that shit?</font>

104
00:14:36,907 --> 00:14:40,193
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He's got enough NOS in there
to blow himself up. Period.</font>

105
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:44,287
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- So, what do you say? Am I worthy?
- We don't know yet.</font>

106
00:14:44,999 --> 00:14:46,790
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">But you're in. Let's go.</font>

107
00:14:47,668 --> 00:14:49,210
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- All right.
- Let's go!</font>

108
00:15:53,651 --> 00:15:57,483
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What the hell is going on around here?
- Street's closed, pizza boy.</font>

109
00:15:57,989 --> 00:16:00,907
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Find another way home.
- Goddamn street racers.</font>

110
00:16:01,659 --> 00:16:05,953
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>Log on, 22. Code 3. Tension is high.
They've blocked the street.</i></font>

111
00:16:52,127 --> 00:16:53,502
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Edwin.</font>

112
00:16:55,047 --> 00:16:58,001
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">This is yours, whether you win or lose.</font>

113
00:16:58,884 --> 00:17:01,505
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">But if you win, you get her, too.</font>

114
00:17:11,021 --> 00:17:12,563
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You're going to win.</font>

115
00:17:13,941 --> 00:17:15,518
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I'm going to win.</font>

116
00:17:59,904 --> 00:18:02,774
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>We had a reported homicide.
187, at Barabian Liquors.</i></font>

117
00:18:02,865 --> 00:18:07,242
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I've got a 187 in Glendale.
Cops are all over it. We're good to roll.</font>

118
00:18:07,954 --> 00:18:09,364
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- All right.
- Let's race!</font>

119
00:18:09,455 --> 00:18:10,486
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Right.</font>

120
00:18:20,258 --> 00:18:21,040
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Go!</font>

121
00:18:35,189 --> 00:18:36,304
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Hell, yeah!</font>

122
00:18:52,373 --> 00:18:53,998
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Damn, that guy's fast.</font>

123
00:19:02,175 --> 00:19:04,333
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Let's go! Mčnage!</font>

124
00:19:31,371 --> 00:19:34,158
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">No! Monica!</font>

125
00:19:49,931 --> 00:19:51,390
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Shut up!</font>

126
00:20:46,113 --> 00:20:47,607
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Well done, baby!</font>

127
00:20:56,999 --> 00:20:58,908
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Come on. Come on. Back up.</font>

128
00:20:59,710 --> 00:21:03,044
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Here's what you won, right here.
There you go.</font>

129
00:21:03,130 --> 00:21:06,001
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You were racing a bunch of skateboards.
Know what I mean?</font>

130
00:21:07,426 --> 00:21:10,096
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">My sister holds the money. Count it.</font>

131
00:21:13,140 --> 00:21:14,718
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">And you're my trophy.</font>

132
00:21:17,979 --> 00:21:21,928
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Hey, Monica. What's up, baby?
- What's your problem? You didn't win.</font>

133
00:21:24,902 --> 00:21:26,183
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Fuck you then!</font>

134
00:21:39,500 --> 00:21:40,781
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Was that fun?</font>

135
00:21:41,002 --> 00:21:42,911
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Got a problem there, buddy?</font>

136
00:21:49,635 --> 00:21:52,886
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What are you smiling about?
- Dude. I almost had you.</font>

137
00:21:55,725 --> 00:21:57,516
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You almost had me?</font>

138
00:21:58,186 --> 00:22:00,641
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You never had me.
You never had your car.</font>

139
00:22:03,942 --> 00:22:07,108
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Granny-shifting.
Not double-clutching, like you should.</font>

140
00:22:08,029 --> 00:22:12,193
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You're lucky that 100-shot of NOS
didn't blow the welds on the intake.</font>

141
00:22:13,451 --> 00:22:17,829
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Almost had me?
- You tell him, Dominic. Get out of here.</font>

142
00:22:19,207 --> 00:22:22,291
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Now, me and the mad scientist
got to rip apart the block...</font>

143
00:22:22,377 --> 00:22:24,950
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">...and replace the piston rings you fried.</font>

144
00:22:32,721 --> 00:22:34,760
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Ask any racer. Any real racer.</font>

145
00:22:35,515 --> 00:22:39,976
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">It don't matter if you win by an inch
or a mile. Winning's winning.</font>

146
00:22:40,270 --> 00:22:41,598
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yeah!</font>

147
00:22:47,194 --> 00:22:50,278
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>All available units,
we have street-racing along Hawthorne....</i></font>

148
00:22:50,363 --> 00:22:52,273
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Oh, shit! We got cops. Cops!</font>

149
00:22:52,574 --> 00:22:53,819
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Go!</font>

150
00:23:05,545 --> 00:23:07,337
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Cops! Get in the car! Go!</font>

151
00:24:31,591 --> 00:24:33,797
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>Toretto, stop right there!</i></font>

152
00:24:35,511 --> 00:24:36,626
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>Toretto!</i></font>

153
00:24:51,652 --> 00:24:52,851
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Get in!</font>

154
00:25:39,367 --> 00:25:42,701
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You're the last person in the world
I expected to show up.</font>

155
00:25:43,872 --> 00:25:47,786
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I thought if I got in your good graces,
you might let me keep my car.</font>

156
00:25:48,043 --> 00:25:51,376
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You are in my good graces,
but you ain't keeping your car.</font>

157
00:25:52,255 --> 00:25:55,256
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You drive like you've done this before.
Are you a wheelman?</font>

158
00:25:55,342 --> 00:25:57,714
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- No.
- You boost cars?</font>

159
00:26:00,138 --> 00:26:02,297
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- No. Never.
- Ever done time?</font>

160
00:26:02,682 --> 00:26:05,008
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Couple of overnighters. No big deal.</font>

161
00:26:05,769 --> 00:26:08,805
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">What about the two years
in juvie for boosting cars?</font>

162
00:26:11,775 --> 00:26:13,269
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Tucson, right?</font>

163
00:26:13,985 --> 00:26:17,070
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I had Jesse run a profile on you,
Brian Earl Spilner.</font>

164
00:26:18,615 --> 00:26:21,782
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He'll find anything on the Web.
Anything about anybody.</font>

165
00:26:22,494 --> 00:26:23,905
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">So, why bullshit?</font>

166
00:26:25,622 --> 00:26:27,116
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">So, what about you?</font>

167
00:26:29,585 --> 00:26:31,079
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Two years in Lompoc.</font>

168
00:26:34,131 --> 00:26:35,922
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I'll die before I go back.</font>

169
00:26:42,055 --> 00:26:44,048
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Oh, great.
- What?</font>

170
00:26:46,977 --> 00:26:49,349
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">It's going to be a long-ass night.
That's what.</font>

171
00:26:53,651 --> 00:26:55,026
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Follow us.</font>

172
00:27:45,745 --> 00:27:49,956
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I thought we had an agreement.
You stay away. I stay away.</font>

173
00:27:51,375 --> 00:27:53,000
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Everybody stays happy.</font>

174
00:27:53,127 --> 00:27:55,452
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">We got lost.
What do you want me to tell you?</font>

175
00:27:55,546 --> 00:27:58,464
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Who's "we"?
- My new mechanic.</font>

176
00:27:58,841 --> 00:28:00,668
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Brian, meet Johnny Tran.</font>

177
00:28:00,802 --> 00:28:03,803
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">The guy in the snakeskin pants.
That's his cousin. Lance.</font>

178
00:28:03,888 --> 00:28:07,589
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">So, when are you going to give me a shot
at that Honda 2000 of yours?</font>

179
00:28:07,684 --> 00:28:10,091
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- This your ride?
- It was. It's his now.</font>

180
00:28:10,520 --> 00:28:13,011
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">No, it's not. I haven't taken delivery.</font>

181
00:28:15,191 --> 00:28:18,892
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Then, it's nobody's car.
But somebody put in the wrench time.</font>

182
00:28:21,948 --> 00:28:25,566
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What do you think, Lance?
- It's an amazing machine.</font>

183
00:28:26,244 --> 00:28:27,703
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yes, indeed.</font>

184
00:28:29,914 --> 00:28:31,325
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Let's go.</font>

185
00:28:33,501 --> 00:28:37,914
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I'll see you in the desert next month.
Be ready to have your ass handed to you.</font>

186
00:28:38,173 --> 00:28:42,040
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- You'll need more than that crotch rocket.
- I got something for you.</font>

187
00:28:55,941 --> 00:28:59,475
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What the hell was that all about?
- Long story. I'll tell you later.</font>

188
00:28:59,569 --> 00:29:01,194
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Let's get out of here.</font>

189
00:29:28,598 --> 00:29:29,713
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">NOS!</font>

190
00:29:41,904 --> 00:29:45,320
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- So, what the hell was that all about?
- It's a long story.</font>

191
00:29:46,200 --> 00:29:48,109
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Well, we got a 20-mile hike. Humor me.</font>

192
00:29:49,119 --> 00:29:51,242
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">A business deal that went sour.</font>

193
00:29:52,206 --> 00:29:55,290
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Plus, I made the mistake
of sleeping with his sister.</font>

194
00:30:21,485 --> 00:30:22,730
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Take care.</font>

195
00:30:27,825 --> 00:30:29,367
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yo, Spilner.</font>

196
00:30:30,786 --> 00:30:32,993
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- You want a beer?
- Yeah, sure.</font>

197
00:30:33,664 --> 00:30:35,242
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Oh, shit.</font>

198
00:30:59,315 --> 00:31:02,269
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">We were all there, right? Falling behind.</font>

199
00:31:02,360 --> 00:31:04,815
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- With all that nitrous.
- Yeah.</font>

200
00:31:11,702 --> 00:31:15,154
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yo, Dom. We were just about to go
looking for you, brother.</font>

201
00:31:21,087 --> 00:31:22,367
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Where were you?</font>

202
00:31:22,463 --> 00:31:26,710
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">There were mass cops there. They came in
from every direction. It was orchestrated.</font>

203
00:31:26,801 --> 00:31:29,173
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- This your beer?
- Yeah, that's my beer.</font>

204
00:31:32,265 --> 00:31:34,756
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yo, Einstein. Take it upstairs.</font>

205
00:31:35,435 --> 00:31:37,973
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You can't detail a car with the cover on.</font>

206
00:31:38,813 --> 00:31:41,684
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Can't even get that right.
- You all right?</font>

207
00:31:43,860 --> 00:31:46,731
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Am I all right?
- It was just a question.</font>

208
00:31:50,492 --> 00:31:51,772
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yo, Dom.</font>

209
00:31:52,035 --> 00:31:56,115
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Why did you bring the buster here?
- 'Cause he kept me out of handcuffs!</font>

210
00:31:56,373 --> 00:32:00,205
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He didn't just run back to the fort!
The buster brought me back.</font>

211
00:32:06,091 --> 00:32:09,839
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You can have any brew you want,
as long as it's a Corona.</font>

212
00:32:10,512 --> 00:32:13,133
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Thanks, man.
- That's Vince's. So, enjoy it.</font>

213
00:32:15,141 --> 00:32:16,386
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You.</font>

214
00:32:23,525 --> 00:32:27,605
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Hey, bro. You got a bathroom?
- Upstairs. First door on the right.</font>

215
00:32:43,837 --> 00:32:47,253
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He's got no call being up in here.
You don't know that fool for shit.</font>

216
00:32:47,341 --> 00:32:50,840
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- He's right, Dom.
- There was a time when I didn't know you.</font>

217
00:32:51,011 --> 00:32:52,920
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">That was in the third grade!</font>

218
00:32:56,141 --> 00:32:59,641
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Yeah. So, what girls are here?
- You name it. You want mine?</font>

219
00:32:59,728 --> 00:33:02,136
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- You need to shut the....
- You want two?</font>

220
00:33:02,356 --> 00:33:05,025
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- You don't have anything?
- You look a bit tired.</font>

221
00:33:05,109 --> 00:33:07,896
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I think you should go upstairs
and give me a massage.</font>

222
00:33:07,986 --> 00:33:11,355
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Look at all our guests.
- How about you give me a massage?</font>

223
00:33:14,702 --> 00:33:16,160
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Crazy lady.</font>

224
00:33:23,836 --> 00:33:26,505
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You know you owe me
a 10-second car, right?</font>

225
00:33:31,135 --> 00:33:32,415
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Oh, shit.</font>

226
00:33:38,184 --> 00:33:39,808
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Did you wipe the seat?</font>

227
00:33:43,063 --> 00:33:46,433
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Jesus Christ! Would you cut this shit?
Come on!</font>

228
00:33:48,530 --> 00:33:53,758
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Come on. Let's go get me a drink.
- We were just about to get along.</font>

229
00:34:00,623 --> 00:34:03,790
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- So, what do you want?
- Anything, as long as it's cold.</font>

230
00:34:05,419 --> 00:34:09,002
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You know, my brother likes you.
He usually doesn't like anybody.</font>

231
00:34:09,090 --> 00:34:12,340
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- He's a complicated guy.
- Yeah? What about you?</font>

232
00:34:15,555 --> 00:34:17,880
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- I'm simpler.
- You're a shitty liar.</font>

233
00:34:19,600 --> 00:34:21,926
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Well, I'll take that as a compliment.</font>

234
00:34:23,604 --> 00:34:26,274
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- But there's a problem.
- What's that?</font>

235
00:34:26,357 --> 00:34:28,564
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You need to get some sleep.</font>

236
00:34:29,152 --> 00:34:33,101
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">And you definitely,
definitely need a shower.</font>

237
00:34:34,073 --> 00:34:36,362
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Come on. I'll take you home.</font>

238
00:34:58,181 --> 00:35:01,098
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>Show me your hands.
Very good. Now open the door.</i></font>

239
00:35:01,601 --> 00:35:04,721
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>Put your hands on your head.
Behind your head.</i></font>

240
00:35:05,271 --> 00:35:08,854
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>Face the front of the vehicle,
walk backwards towards the rear.</i></font>

241
00:35:09,067 --> 00:35:12,436
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>Take two steps to your right.
Stop right there.</i></font>

242
00:35:15,490 --> 00:35:19,440
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What did I do?
- Shut up. He's clean, Sarge.</font>

243
00:35:30,213 --> 00:35:32,539
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Damn!
Muse, will you take these things off?</font>

244
00:35:32,632 --> 00:35:35,550
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Shit. You put them on so tight.
- I like realism.</font>

245
00:35:36,178 --> 00:35:38,503
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You never know who's watching, Brian.</font>

246
00:35:42,809 --> 00:35:46,593
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Nice crib, Sergeant. It's a lot nicer
than the last place you confiscated.</font>

247
00:35:46,688 --> 00:35:50,900
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Ain't it? Eddie Fisher built this house
for Elizabeth Taylor in the '50s.</font>

248
00:35:51,068 --> 00:35:53,985
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You see, even the cops
are Hollywood in Hollywood.</font>

249
00:35:57,741 --> 00:36:01,075
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Okay, here he is,
fresh from Toretto's hot rod heaven.</font>

250
00:36:01,161 --> 00:36:03,486
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">That was an $80,000 vehicle, Officer.</font>

251
00:36:03,580 --> 00:36:05,787
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- You told him what happened?
- He knows.</font>

252
00:36:05,874 --> 00:36:09,789
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Send the bill to Johnny Tran.
- The kid's giving me attitude?</font>

253
00:36:09,878 --> 00:36:12,630
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">It doesn't speak well
for police/FBI relations, Tanner.</font>

254
00:36:12,714 --> 00:36:16,333
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- I walk in the door and the guy's already--
- All right, all right.</font>

255
00:36:16,427 --> 00:36:18,633
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">We'll talk, okay? Let's talk about it.</font>

256
00:36:18,721 --> 00:36:22,006
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Muse, why don't you make us
four iced cappuccinos, please?</font>

257
00:36:22,099 --> 00:36:24,424
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Come on.
- Regular or decaf, Sarge?</font>

258
00:36:26,020 --> 00:36:27,430
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Decaf, I think.</font>

259
00:36:27,771 --> 00:36:30,476
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Four hijackings in two months,
and we have nothing.</font>

260
00:36:30,566 --> 00:36:33,650
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">The DVD players and digital cameras
are worth $1.2 million...</font>

261
00:36:33,736 --> 00:36:36,523
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">...which brings the grand total
to $6 million plus.</font>

262
00:36:36,614 --> 00:36:39,449
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">We're in the political crosshairs now, Brian.</font>

263
00:36:40,201 --> 00:36:42,027
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">That's why you're undercover.</font>

264
00:36:42,119 --> 00:36:46,069
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You want that detective badge fast, kid.
And you want to know something?</font>

265
00:36:46,415 --> 00:36:49,250
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">The FBI can help,
if you come through for us.</font>

266
00:36:50,294 --> 00:36:52,251
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">What does the truckdriver say?</font>

267
00:36:52,338 --> 00:36:55,873
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He gave us the same M.O.:
Three Honda Civics, precision driving...</font>

268
00:36:55,966 --> 00:36:58,920
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">...the same green neon glow
from under the chassis.</font>

269
00:36:59,011 --> 00:37:03,472
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Lab says the skidmarks came back
the same: Mashamoto ZX tires.</font>

270
00:37:03,557 --> 00:37:06,262
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">So, we know it's somebody
in the street-racing world.</font>

271
00:37:06,352 --> 00:37:10,813
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">If we don't make this case, the truckers
will take matters into their own hands.</font>

272
00:37:10,898 --> 00:37:12,606
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I tell them we're close.</font>

273
00:37:13,818 --> 00:37:15,727
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Are you going to make me a liar?</font>

274
00:37:15,820 --> 00:37:17,362
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Look, what do we know?</font>

275
00:37:17,446 --> 00:37:19,937
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">We know this world
revolves around Toretto, right?</font>

276
00:37:20,032 --> 00:37:23,117
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I'm not saying that he's the one
that's popping these trucks...</font>

277
00:37:23,202 --> 00:37:27,532
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">...but I can guarantee he knows who is.
It's just a matter of time until I win--</font>

278
00:37:27,623 --> 00:37:31,573
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You want time, buy the magazine.
We don't have time.</font>

279
00:37:33,379 --> 00:37:35,455
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Just get me something I can use.</font>

280
00:37:37,300 --> 00:37:38,960
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Is Harry cooperating?</font>

281
00:37:39,052 --> 00:37:42,634
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Like a guy that'll do time
for receiving stolen property if he doesn't.</font>

282
00:37:42,722 --> 00:37:44,845
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">What kind of vibe
is he getting from Toretto?</font>

283
00:37:44,932 --> 00:37:48,052
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He's scared of him,
but he doesn't think he's jacking trucks.</font>

284
00:37:48,144 --> 00:37:50,516
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- He's too controlled for that.
- Wait.</font>

285
00:37:50,605 --> 00:37:53,725
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Not that I want to contradict
Harry's fine judge of character...</font>

286
00:37:53,816 --> 00:37:57,351
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">...but Toretto did hard time
for nearly beating a guy to death.</font>

287
00:37:57,445 --> 00:38:00,565
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He's got nitrous oxide in his blood
and a gas tank for a brain.</font>

288
00:38:00,657 --> 00:38:02,566
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Do not turn your back on him.</font>

289
00:38:02,992 --> 00:38:04,535
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Tanner, I'm gonna need another car.</font>

290
00:38:10,083 --> 00:38:12,490
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What about parts and service?
- Hold off on it.</font>

291
00:38:12,585 --> 00:38:14,911
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Dom, I don't know what to do with it.</font>

292
00:38:18,008 --> 00:38:21,840
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">All right, what the hell is this?
What do you got there?</font>

293
00:38:23,596 --> 00:38:26,004
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- This is your car.
- My car?</font>

294
00:38:26,641 --> 00:38:29,595
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I said a 10-second car, not a 10-minute car.</font>

295
00:38:29,686 --> 00:38:33,518
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You could push this across the finish line,
or tow it.</font>

296
00:38:34,816 --> 00:38:37,734
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You couldn't even tow that
across the finish line.</font>

297
00:38:38,487 --> 00:38:39,685
