00:54:00,542 --> 00:54:04,409
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">And truckers arming themselves for some
good old-fashioned vigilante mayhem.</font>

452
00:54:04,504 --> 00:54:08,584
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Tell us about Hector, Brian.
- Latinos with spear guns. Give me a break.</font>

453
00:54:08,842 --> 00:54:12,424
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Hector's still working on the engines,
but the tires don't match.</font>

454
00:54:12,512 --> 00:54:14,303
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Will somebody give me a cigarette?</font>

455
00:54:14,389 --> 00:54:16,512
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Get him a cigarette.
- Don't give him one.</font>

456
00:54:16,766 --> 00:54:19,222
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- I thought you quit.
- I did. Just give me one.</font>

457
00:54:19,311 --> 00:54:21,054
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Get him a cigarette.
- No!</font>

458
00:54:23,356 --> 00:54:24,981
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Tell me about Toretto.</font>

459
00:54:25,233 --> 00:54:28,020
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I told you,
I think he's too controlled for this.</font>

460
00:54:28,111 --> 00:54:32,738
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Going suicidal on semi-trucks? No way.
Maybe Vince. But he's too dumb to do it.</font>

461
00:54:33,116 --> 00:54:36,781
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- I think the kid sister's blurring your vision.
- What did you say?</font>

462
00:54:36,870 --> 00:54:40,453
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I don't blame you.
I'd get off on her surveillance photos, too.</font>

463
00:54:43,251 --> 00:54:44,496
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Knock it off!</font>

464
00:54:45,670 --> 00:54:48,208
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">What? Are you going native on me, Brian?</font>

465
00:54:52,886 --> 00:54:55,128
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Have you read Toretto's file lately?</font>

466
00:54:55,389 --> 00:54:57,714
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Yeah. I memorized that file.
- Read it again.</font>

467
00:54:57,808 --> 00:55:00,215
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">No, better still, take a look at these.</font>

468
00:55:02,020 --> 00:55:05,389
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Remember I told you about the guy
he nearly beat to death?</font>

469
00:55:05,816 --> 00:55:09,101
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Toretto did this
with a three-quarter-inch torque wrench.</font>

470
00:55:09,611 --> 00:55:11,568
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He's a model of self-control.</font>

471
00:55:14,491 --> 00:55:16,199
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I need a few more days.</font>

472
00:55:18,954 --> 00:55:20,152
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I need a few more days.</font>

473
00:55:23,083 --> 00:55:24,661
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Got a TR7 here,
with a ball-bearing upgrade.</font>

474
00:55:26,045 --> 00:55:29,912
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">What it's going to do is,
it's going to spool up really quick.</font>

475
00:55:30,090 --> 00:55:32,581
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- I got this set up for 24 psi.
- Got it.</font>

476
00:55:36,096 --> 00:55:37,888
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You got big plans tonight?</font>

477
00:55:40,017 --> 00:55:42,175
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yeah. We're going out to dinner.</font>

478
00:55:43,771 --> 00:55:46,344
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You break her heart, I'll break your neck.</font>

479
00:55:46,982 --> 00:55:48,477
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">That's not gonna happen.</font>

480
00:55:53,656 --> 00:55:55,483
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I want to show you something.</font>

481
00:56:09,755 --> 00:56:11,463
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Me and my dad built her.</font>

482
00:56:12,341 --> 00:56:14,713
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Nine hundred horses of Detroit muscle.</font>

483
00:56:16,012 --> 00:56:17,257
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">It's a beast.</font>

484
00:56:17,847 --> 00:56:20,717
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- You know what she ran in Palmdale?
- No. What?</font>

485
00:56:20,892 --> 00:56:22,350
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Nine seconds flat.</font>

486
00:56:23,853 --> 00:56:25,976
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- God.
- My dad was driving.</font>

487
00:56:26,522 --> 00:56:30,734
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">So much torque,
the chassis twisted coming off the line.</font>

488
00:56:31,819 --> 00:56:33,776
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Barely kept her on the track.</font>

489
00:56:34,530 --> 00:56:37,448
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- So, what's your best time?
- I've never driven her.</font>

490
00:56:37,533 --> 00:56:38,613
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Why not?</font>

491
00:56:41,371 --> 00:56:43,328
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">It scares the shit out of me.</font>

492
00:56:45,750 --> 00:56:46,995
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">That's my dad.</font>

493
00:56:48,503 --> 00:56:51,208
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He was coming up
in the pro stock-car circuit.</font>

494
00:56:51,631 --> 00:56:53,339
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Last race of the season.</font>

495
00:56:54,467 --> 00:56:58,679
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">A guy named Kenny Linder
came up from inside, in the final turn.</font>

496
00:56:59,514 --> 00:57:03,013
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He clipped his bumper
and put him into the wall at 120.</font>

497
00:57:06,187 --> 00:57:08,559
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I watched my dad burn to death.</font>

498
00:57:11,109 --> 00:57:13,185
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I remembered hearing him scream.</font>

499
00:57:16,364 --> 00:57:20,907
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">But the people that were there
said he had died before the tanks blew.</font>

500
00:57:27,292 --> 00:57:29,664
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">They said it was me who was screaming.</font>

501
00:57:33,214 --> 00:57:35,622
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I saw Linder about a week later.</font>

502
00:57:37,010 --> 00:57:40,426
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I had a wrench, and I hit him.</font>

503
00:57:40,764 --> 00:57:45,473
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">And I didn't intend to keep hitting him,
but when I finished, I couldn't lift my arm.</font>

504
00:57:50,857 --> 00:57:53,146
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He's a janitor at a high school.</font>

505
00:57:54,277 --> 00:57:56,815
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He has to take the bus to work every day.</font>

506
00:57:58,031 --> 00:58:00,736
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">And they banned me
from the tracks for life.</font>

507
00:58:06,373 --> 00:58:08,864
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I live my life a quarter-mile at a time.</font>

508
00:58:10,711 --> 00:58:13,498
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Nothing else matters.
Not the mortgage, not the store...</font>

509
00:58:13,589 --> 00:58:16,080
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">...not my team and all their bullshit.</font>

510
00:58:17,801 --> 00:58:20,173
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">For those 10 seconds or less...</font>

511
00:58:21,680 --> 00:58:23,340
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">...I'm free.</font>

512
00:58:43,827 --> 00:58:47,078
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">So, how is it, anyways,
that the gang came to be?</font>

513
00:58:47,331 --> 00:58:48,446
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What?
- The gang.</font>

514
00:58:48,540 --> 00:58:50,948
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">The gang?
No, they don't call themselves a gang.</font>

515
00:58:51,043 --> 00:58:53,368
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What do they call themselves?
- They're a team.</font>

516
00:58:53,462 --> 00:58:57,460
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- They call themselves a team.
- All right. How did the team come to be?</font>

517
00:58:57,925 --> 00:59:00,214
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Well, that's a whole lot of history.</font>

518
00:59:01,637 --> 00:59:05,338
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- I've got time.
- Okay. Vince grew up with my brother.</font>

519
00:59:06,308 --> 00:59:09,428
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Actually, he didn't ever actually grow up,
as you can tell.</font>

520
00:59:09,520 --> 00:59:11,513
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">But they were friends as kids.</font>

521
00:59:11,731 --> 00:59:14,304
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">And Letty, she just lived down the street.</font>

522
00:59:14,483 --> 00:59:17,733
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Always into cars, though.
Ever since she was, like, 10 years old.</font>

523
00:59:17,820 --> 00:59:21,403
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">So, naturally, you know,
my brother always had her attention.</font>

524
00:59:22,074 --> 00:59:25,739
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- And then she turned 16--
- And then she had Dom's attention.</font>

525
00:59:26,037 --> 00:59:28,954
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yeah. It's funny how that works, isn't it?</font>

526
00:59:29,707 --> 00:59:30,952
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yeah.</font>

527
00:59:34,253 --> 00:59:36,744
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">How does Jesse fit into the whole thing?</font>

528
00:59:36,881 --> 00:59:41,839
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Jesse. Well, Jesse and Leon just sort of
showed up one night and never, ever left.</font>

529
00:59:42,678 --> 00:59:45,964
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">It's just the way my brother is, you know.
Dom's like....</font>

530
00:59:47,517 --> 00:59:49,474
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He's like gravity.</font>

531
00:59:50,603 --> 00:59:52,809
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Everything just gets pulled to him.</font>

532
00:59:54,440 --> 00:59:55,816
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Even you.</font>

533
00:59:58,027 --> 00:59:59,403
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">No.</font>

534
00:59:59,529 --> 01:00:00,904
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">No.</font>

535
01:00:01,364 --> 01:00:04,199
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">The only thing that pulled me in was you.</font>

536
01:00:04,284 --> 01:00:07,119
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Being friends with your brother
is just a bonus.</font>

537
01:00:09,873 --> 01:00:11,415
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">That's good.</font>

538
01:00:13,251 --> 01:00:16,786
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">That's good. It's nice to come first
every once in a while.</font>

539
01:00:20,425 --> 01:00:21,456
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Want to go for a drive?</font>

540
01:01:00,173 --> 01:01:02,415
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Yeah?
<i>- The hijackers have hit again.</i></font>

541
01:01:02,509 --> 01:01:07,586
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>Bilkins has decided that we're gonna move
on Johnny Tran and his guys at 17:00.</i></font>

542
01:01:07,681 --> 01:01:09,555
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>Unless you say otherwise.</i></font>

543
01:01:09,641 --> 01:01:11,515
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>If you agree, just say yes.</i></font>

544
01:01:12,144 --> 01:01:14,136
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Yeah.
- Who is that?</font>

545
01:01:16,398 --> 01:01:18,141
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">It's just a wrong number.</font>

546
01:04:10,365 --> 01:04:12,524
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yes, sir. Yeah, I know, but--</font>

547
01:04:12,743 --> 01:04:15,412
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yeah. Yes, sir.</font>

548
01:04:15,620 --> 01:04:17,031
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yeah. I got it.</font>

549
01:04:21,418 --> 01:04:23,457
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">The DVD players were purchased legally.</font>

550
01:04:23,545 --> 01:04:26,795
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">All we've got are a couple
of low-rent weapons charges...</font>

551
01:04:26,882 --> 01:04:29,171
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">...and some outstanding speeding tickets.</font>

552
01:04:29,259 --> 01:04:30,919
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- So, they're out.
- Yeah.</font>

553
01:04:31,136 --> 01:04:32,714
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Father bailed them out.</font>

554
01:04:33,847 --> 01:04:37,596
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Is this the kind of intelligence
I can expect from you, O'Conner?</font>

555
01:04:42,439 --> 01:04:45,606
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- You're gonna put this on me?
- I can put it on whoever I want to.</font>

556
01:04:45,692 --> 01:04:48,397
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Perks of the job.
- No, you can't put this on me--</font>

557
01:04:48,487 --> 01:04:50,361
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">No, wait a minute. Let me tell you.</font>

558
01:04:50,447 --> 01:04:54,659
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I don't care if you have to aim at someone
and blow your cover to smithereens.</font>

559
01:04:54,743 --> 01:04:57,281
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You've got 36 hours to crack this bastard...</font>

560
01:04:57,371 --> 01:05:00,455
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">...or you might want to think
about another career.</font>

561
01:05:11,510 --> 01:05:14,926
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">It's Toretto, Brian.
It always has been Toretto.</font>

562
01:05:16,307 --> 01:05:18,180
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Tran and Hector are....</font>

563
01:05:18,601 --> 01:05:20,392
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">They're just fumes.</font>

564
01:05:23,647 --> 01:05:26,352
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I know you've been lying to me.
My question is this:</font>

565
01:05:26,442 --> 01:05:30,107
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Have you been lying to yourself
because you can't see past Mia?</font>

566
01:05:32,740 --> 01:05:34,733
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He won't go back to prison.</font>

567
01:05:35,701 --> 01:05:38,572
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Well, that's a choice
he's going to have to make.</font>

568
01:05:42,667 --> 01:05:45,074
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">There's all kinds of family, Brian.</font>

569
01:05:46,504 --> 01:05:49,291
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">And that's a choice
you're gonna have to make.</font>

570
01:06:07,316 --> 01:06:09,309
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You ready for this?</font>

571
01:06:35,720 --> 01:06:38,555
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Nice car.
What's the retail on one of those?</font>

572
01:06:39,182 --> 01:06:41,755
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">More than you can afford, pal. Ferrari.</font>

573
01:06:47,941 --> 01:06:49,435
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Smoke him.</font>

574
01:07:44,373 --> 01:07:46,164
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">So, what's wrong, Brian?</font>

575
01:07:47,125 --> 01:07:48,833
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Nothing, man, I'm fine.</font>

576
01:07:49,294 --> 01:07:52,544
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Come on. Obviously something's off.</font>

577
01:07:53,090 --> 01:07:56,790
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Look, I have my good days and bad days
just like anybody else.</font>

578
01:07:57,469 --> 01:08:01,052
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Brian, don't lose that cool of yours.
That's your meal ticket.</font>

579
01:08:03,016 --> 01:08:05,852
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">My meal ticket?
I can't pay for my own shrimp?</font>

580
01:08:06,019 --> 01:08:07,478
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I got the shrimp.</font>

581
01:08:07,896 --> 01:08:10,470
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">No, that's one thing about me
you don't understand.</font>

582
01:08:10,566 --> 01:08:14,231
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I don't take handouts.
I earn my way, every step.</font>

583
01:08:15,154 --> 01:08:17,526
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I need something extra on the side,
like you.</font>

584
01:08:17,615 --> 01:08:19,572
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">What do you mean, like me?</font>

585
01:08:19,867 --> 01:08:22,737
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What's that supposed to mean?
- That's what I mean.</font>

586
01:08:22,828 --> 01:08:25,533
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What does that mean, like me?
- Don't try--</font>

587
01:08:25,831 --> 01:08:27,740
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I'm not stupid, all right?</font>

588
01:08:28,125 --> 01:08:32,205
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I know that there's no way you paid
for all that shit you got under the hood--</font>

589
01:08:32,296 --> 01:08:35,665
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">There's no way you paid for
what's under the hood of those cars...</font>

590
01:08:35,758 --> 01:08:38,510
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">...by doing tune-ups and selling groceries.</font>

591
01:08:39,345 --> 01:08:42,346
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Whatever it is you're in on,
I want in on it, too.</font>

592
01:09:05,204 --> 01:09:07,280
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Well, what is this?
- Read it.</font>

593
01:09:08,082 --> 01:09:10,371
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What is this for?
- It's directions.</font>

594
01:09:12,378 --> 01:09:14,086
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">To Race Wars.</font>

595
01:09:14,589 --> 01:09:16,380
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">We'll see how you go.</font>

596
01:09:17,383 --> 01:09:19,008
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Then we'll talk.</font>

597
01:10:05,306 --> 01:10:06,931
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- How's it going?
- What's up?</font>

598
01:10:07,017 --> 01:10:09,686
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Welcome to Race Wars.
- Great. Thanks a lot.</font>

599
01:10:33,085 --> 01:10:34,792
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Baby. Hey, baby.</font>

600
01:10:35,962 --> 01:10:37,789
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You should watch from the side.</font>

601
01:10:37,881 --> 01:10:40,337
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I wouldn't want to get exhaust
on that pretty face.</font>

602
01:10:40,425 --> 01:10:44,505
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Put your money where your mouth is.
- I'll race you for that sweet little ass.</font>

603
01:10:44,596 --> 01:10:47,052
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You want ass,
why don't you hit Hollywood Boulevard?</font>

604
01:10:47,140 --> 01:10:50,225
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You want an adrenaline rush,
it'll be two large.</font>

605
01:10:50,310 --> 01:10:53,311
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Right here. Right now.
What's it gonna be?</font>

606
01:10:55,983 --> 01:10:57,393
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You got it.</font>

607
01:11:17,421 --> 01:11:19,460
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">"Another one bites the dust"</font>

608
01:11:22,760 --> 01:11:24,669
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Come on. What you got?</font>

609
01:11:25,387 --> 01:11:26,846
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">See ya.</font>

610
01:12:02,842 --> 01:12:05,796
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What's up?
- Hey, what's up, Jesse?</font>

611
01:12:06,262 --> 01:12:07,542
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">What's in your hand?</font>

612
01:12:07,638 --> 01:12:10,010
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Throwing down the pink slip, just like you.</font>

613
01:12:10,099 --> 01:12:12,720
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- The pink slip to what? The Jetta?
- Yeah.</font>

614
01:12:13,144 --> 01:12:15,682
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- You can't bet your dad's car.
- It's all right.</font>

615
01:12:15,771 --> 01:12:17,052
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I ain't losing.</font>

616
01:12:17,148 --> 01:12:20,647
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">This fool is running a Honda 2000.
I'll win.</font>

617
01:12:20,818 --> 01:12:25,361
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">That way, me and my dad can roll
when he gets out of prison. It's all good.</font>

618
01:12:25,448 --> 01:12:29,066
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">They're gonna throw him right back
in prison after he kills you.</font>

619
01:12:36,709 --> 01:12:38,666
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You visualize the win.</font>

620
01:12:38,753 --> 01:12:42,418
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Visualize the win, Jesse. I'm serious.
You got to listen to me, man.</font>

621
01:12:42,507 --> 01:12:44,049
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Who are you racing?</font>

622
01:12:48,429 --> 01:12:50,636
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Jesse, don't do it.</font>

623
01:12:50,765 --> 01:12:54,430
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I bet you he's got more than $100,000
under the hood of that car.</font>

624
01:13:17,584 --> 01:13:19,161
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Too soon, junior.</font>

625
01:13:22,797 --> 01:13:23,663
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">No!</font>

626
01:13:26,801 --> 01:13:28,000
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Shit!</font>

627
01:13:28,637 --> 01:13:29,799
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Oh, God!</font>

628
01:13:40,232 --> 01:13:42,901
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yo! Heads up, bro. We got problems.</font>

629
01:13:42,984 --> 01:13:44,728
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What?
- Jesse.</font>

630
01:13:46,238 --> 01:13:48,277
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Where's Jesse going?</font>

631
01:13:48,448 --> 01:13:51,948
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- He just raced Tran for slips.
- Oh, shit.</font>

632
01:14:03,630 --> 01:14:06,750
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Where's he going?
- He went to the car wash.</font>

633
01:14:06,967 --> 01:14:08,924
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Whatever. Go fetch my car.</font>

634
01:14:09,511 --> 01:14:11,136
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Go fetch your car?</font>

635
01:14:12,097 --> 01:14:13,757
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">We're not on your block.</font>

636
01:14:13,849 --> 01:14:16,470
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You better watch who you talk to like that.</font>

637
01:14:17,019 --> 01:14:18,133
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Toretto!</font>

638
01:14:21,440 --> 01:14:23,314
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">SWAT came into my house...</font>

639
01:14:24,276 --> 01:14:28,523
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">...disrespected my whole family,
because somebody narked me out.</font>

640
01:14:29,239 --> 01:14:31,695
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">And you know what? It was you!</font>

641
01:14:56,058 --> 01:14:58,098
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Get off of him, man.</font>

642
01:15:07,445 --> 01:15:09,236
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Dom, chill out, man. Come on!</font>

643
01:15:09,322 --> 01:15:11,113
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I never narked on nobody!</font>

644
01:15:11,240 --> 01:15:13,731
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I never narked on nobody!</font>

645
01:15:52,740 --> 01:15:53,820
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Mia.</font>

646
01:15:58,580 --> 01:16:00,952
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I have respected you
and I haven't said shit.</font>

647
01:16:01,040 --> 01:16:02,784
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Now I am asking you not to go.</font>

648
01:16:02,876 --> 01:16:05,746
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- I'm doing this for both of us.
- Don't give me that crap.</font>

649
01:16:05,837 --> 01:16:07,296
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You're doing this for you.</font>

650
01:16:07,380 --> 01:16:11,508
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Why are you insisting on doing this?
Dom, please, just don't.</font>

651
01:16:23,480 --> 01:16:25,971
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Mia, what's going on?
- What?</font>

652
01:16:26,066 --> 01:16:28,557
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- You know what I'm talking about.
- No, I don't.</font>

653
01:16:28,652 --> 01:16:31,902
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You always have tears in your eyes
when Dom drives away?</font>

654
01:16:32,030 --> 01:16:33,572
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">What's the matter with you?</font>

655
01:16:33,657 --> 01:16:36,230
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">What's he racing off
in the middle of the night for?</font>

656
01:16:36,326 --> 01:16:39,493
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- You know about the trucks?
- No, Brian! What trucks?</font>

657
01:16:39,579 --> 01:16:43,447
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Jesus Christ. What?
- Listen to me.</font>

658
01:16:44,709 --> 01:16:46,168
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Mia, I'm a cop.</font>

659
01:16:47,712 --> 01:16:50,382
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">What are you talking about, Brian?
What is this?</font>

660
01:16:50,465 --> 01:16:53,917
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Ever since the first time I met you,
I've been undercover.</font>

661
01:16:55,178 --> 01:16:56,376
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I'm a cop.</font>

662
01:17:01,435 --> 01:17:03,059
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Oh, you bastard.</font>

663
01:17:05,897 --> 01:17:07,178
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You bastard.</font>

664
01:17:09,568 --> 01:17:11,395
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Mia.
- Get off of me, Brian!</font>

665
01:17:11,486 --> 01:17:13,230
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Mia! Listen to me!</font>

666
01:17:14,489 --> 01:17:17,063
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Everything I ever said
I felt about you was real.</font>

667
01:17:17,159 --> 01:17:19,780
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I swear to God.
You have to believe me, Mia.</font>

668
01:17:19,870 --> 01:17:23,488
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">But this isn't about you and me.
Your brother's out there to pull a job.</font>

669
01:17:23,582 --> 01:17:27,033
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">We're running out of time. Those truckers
aren't laying down anymore.</font>

670
01:17:27,127 --> 01:17:30,876
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Maybe they'll make it through tonight,
but every law enforcement agency...</font>

671
01:17:30,964 --> 01:17:32,672
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">...is coming down on them.</font>

672
01:17:32,758 --> 01:17:35,675
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">If you don't want anything to happen
to them...</font>

673
01:17:35,761 --> 01:17:38,845
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">...you have to get in that car
with me right now and help me.</font>

674
01:17:40,391 --> 01:17:43,724
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Mia, you are the only person
that can help me right now.</font>

675
01:17:44,520 --> 01:17:47,853
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Please, Mia. Please help me.</font>

676
01:17:59,785 --> 01:18:02,620
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Civics are stashed somewhere
outside of Thermal.</font>

677
01:18:02,705 --> 01:18:05,990
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">They wouldn't double back,
and Highway 10 is too well patrolled.</font>

678
01:18:06,083 --> 01:18:09,037
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- So, what does that leave us with?
- All this.</font>

679
01:18:17,970 --> 01:18:20,841
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>- Nextel.</i>
- This is Officer Brian O'Conner.</font>

680
01:18:21,015 --> 01:18:25,392
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Serial number 34762.
I need a cell phone trace.</font>

681
01:18:25,603 --> 01:18:28,639
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>- Okay. What's the cell number?</i>
- Mia, what is it?</font>

682
01:18:30,775 --> 01:18:33,941
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Come on, Mia.
She needs Dom's cell phone number now.</font>

683
01:18:37,281 --> 01:18:41,990
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">323-555-6439.</font>

684
01:18:43,079 --> 01:18:45,652
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Thank you. Yeah, you get that?</font>

685
01:19:11,858 --> 01:19:15,690
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">All right, we're one man short.
Letty, I need you on the left side.</font>

686
01:19:17,989 --> 01:19:21,323
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Your sister's right about this one.
This don't feel good.</font>

687
01:19:21,451 --> 01:19:25,579
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Don't do that.
- Something's wrong.</font>

688
01:19:25,663 --> 01:19:28,499
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Stop.
- We shouldn't be doing this without Jesse.</font>

689
01:19:29,626 --> 01:19:32,580
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">This is the mother Iode.
We've been on this for three months.</font>

690
01:19:32,670 --> 01:19:35,162
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">After this, it's a long vacation for everyone.</font>

691
01:19:35,256 --> 01:19:37,214
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Let's go.
- I hope so.</font>

692
01:19:40,762 --> 01:19:43,846
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Listen, the other night I had a dream...</font>

693
01:19:44,349 --> 01:19:47,054
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">...that you and I were
on the beach in Mexico.</font>

694
01:19:47,435 --> 01:19:49,475
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Really?
- Really.</font>

695
01:19:52,649 --> 01:19:54,807
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Come on. Let's make this happen.</font>

696
01:19:57,904 --> 01:20:02,400
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Leon, keep on those scanners.
- Copy that.</font>

697
01:20:05,954 --> 01:20:07,994
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">All right, let's go.</font>

698
01:20:18,592 --> 01:20:21,676
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>Okay, we traced the number
to the northbound 86.</i></font>

699
01:20:21,762 --> 01:20:26,258
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>Mile 114, outside Coachella.
We'll keep the trace open, Officer.</i></font>

700
01:20:26,600 --> 01:20:28,011
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Let me see this.</font>

701
01:20:32,814 --> 01:20:35,056
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I think we're about 40 miles away.</font>

702
01:20:35,484 --> 01:20:37,108
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">What are you gonna do?</font>

703
01:20:38,403 --> 01:20:40,396
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">What are you gonna do?</font>

704
01:21:12,688 --> 01:21:14,764
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Okay! Go time!</font>

705
01:21:30,456 --> 01:21:32,912
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">We're all good.
I got nothing on the scanners.</font>

706
01:21:33,000 --> 01:21:34,281
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Keep going.</font>

707
01:21:48,850 --> 01:21:50,012
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Vince!</font>

708
01:21:50,685 --> 01:21:52,761
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Vince, don't! Get back in!</font>

709
01:21:54,355 --> 01:21:55,470
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Vince!</font>

710
01:22:01,112 --> 01:22:02,820
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He's got a damn shotgun! Leon!</font>

711
01:22:02,905 --> 01:22:05,194
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Back off! Get him off of there!</font>

712
01:22:07,869 --> 01:22:09,149
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Oh, shit!</font>

713
01:22:20,214 --> 01:22:22,884
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Get me off this thing! Pull up!</font>

714
01:22:24,010 --> 01:22:27,344
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Unhook yourself. Do it!</font>

715
01:22:27,722 --> 01:22:29,715
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Do it!
- I can't get--</font>

716
01:22:29,808 --> 01:22:31,183
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You can do it!</font>

717
01:22:32,227 --> 01:22:33,685
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Come on, Vince!</font>

718
01:22:41,194 --> 01:22:43,767
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Dom! I'm pulling up to distract him!</font>

719
01:22:51,246 --> 01:22:52,705
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Come on, boy!</font>

720
01:22:53,915 --> 01:22:56,038
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Shot doesn't get better than this.</font>

721
01:23:01,089 --> 01:23:02,370
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Son of a bitch!</font>

722
01:23:07,220 --> 01:23:09,546
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Take me off here,
or I'll have to unhook the wire!</font>

723
01:23:09,639 --> 01:23:13,886
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Try it again. One, two, three!</font>

724
01:23:25,906 --> 01:23:27,483
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Unhook yourself!</font>

725
01:23:29,242 --> 01:23:31,116
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I can't get my arm free!</font>

726
01:23:31,203 --> 01:23:33,445
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Vince, grab my hand!
- My arm!</font>

727
01:23:33,538 --> 01:23:35,330
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Listen, give me your hand.</font>

728
01:23:35,499 --> 01:23:37,954
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I'm gonna pull you off the rig!</font>

729
01:23:41,129 --> 01:23:42,754
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Vince!</font>

730
01:23:42,840 --> 01:23:44,832
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Hold on!</font>

731
01:23:44,925 --> 01:23:47,048
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Give me your hand! Listen to me!</font>

732
01:23:53,892 --> 01:23:54,888
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Dominic!</font>

733
01:23:54,977 --> 01:23:56,175
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Shit!</font>

734
01:23:59,732 --> 01:24:01,855
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Dominic!
- Hang on!</font>

735
01:24:02,443 --> 01:24:05,360
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Dom! Move out of the way.
I'm coming to get him.</font>

736
01:24:30,471 --> 01:24:31,799
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Letty!</font>

737
01:24:32,598 --> 01:24:33,629
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Leon!</font>

738
01:24:33,724 --> 01:24:34,803
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Pull back for Letty.</font>

739
01:24:34,892 --> 01:24:36,172
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua"><i>Get her out of there!</i></font>

740
01:24:36,268 --> 01:24:37,679
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I'm on it! Go!</font>

741
01:24:46,862 --> 01:24:49,532
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I've got her! You get Vince off that truck.</font>

742
01:24:54,871 --> 01:24:57,112
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Letty! Come on, baby.</font>

743
01:24:58,165 --> 01:24:59,245
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You okay?</font>

744
01:24:59,333 --> 01:25:01,741
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Oh, shit. Come on, girl, you all right?</font>

745
01:25:01,836 --> 01:25:05,419
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Come on, let me look at you.
Come on. We got to go. Let's go.</font>

746
01:25:19,228 --> 01:25:20,723
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Vince!</font>

747
01:25:49,008 --> 01:25:50,171
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Take the wheel.</font>

748
01:25:50,260 --> 01:25:52,965
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- What do you mean?
- Put your foot on the gas!</font>

749
01:25:53,722 --> 01:25:56,010
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I'm gonna get him.
Put your foot on the gas!</font>

750
01:25:56,099 --> 01:25:57,344
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Okay!</font>

751
01:26:00,729 --> 01:26:03,813
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Come on. Keep it steady.
- I got it!</font>

752
01:26:05,358 --> 01:26:07,315
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">All right, hold on, Vince.</font>

753
01:26:08,111 --> 01:26:11,029
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He's having a hard time holding on.
Get me a little closer.</font>

754
01:26:11,114 --> 01:26:12,395
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">All right.</font>

755
01:26:13,241 --> 01:26:15,400
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Closer.
- I'm moving in.</font>

756
01:26:15,785 --> 01:26:17,363
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Hold it right there!</font>

757
01:26:18,205 --> 01:26:19,284
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Go!</font>

758
01:26:21,458 --> 01:26:24,031
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You got to hang in here with me now!</font>

759
01:26:24,127 --> 01:26:26,286
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">We'll get you off. Give me your arm!</font>

760
01:26:26,379 --> 01:26:28,538
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Vince, look at me! Don't let go!</font>

761
01:26:32,511 --> 01:26:35,084
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Come on, Vince!
Throw this arm around me!</font>

762
01:26:35,889 --> 01:26:38,214
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Vince, don't let go!</font>

763
01:26:42,437 --> 01:26:44,513
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Come on, Mia. Get closer!</font>

764
01:26:50,070 --> 01:26:51,778
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Mia, get closer! Come on.</font>

765
01:26:51,864 --> 01:26:53,737
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Come on, Vince. Here we go!</font>

766
01:27:21,810 --> 01:27:23,091
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Shit.</font>

767
01:27:26,732 --> 01:27:30,267
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">It's gonna be okay, Letty. I love you.</font>

768
01:27:33,531 --> 01:27:35,155
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Watch her.
- I got her.</font>

769
01:27:36,075 --> 01:27:38,613
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Come on, Vince! Hang in there! Come on!</font>

770
01:27:42,790 --> 01:27:45,957
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">If he doesn't get to an ambulance
in 10 minutes, he's dead.</font>

771
01:27:46,043 --> 01:27:48,499
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Hold the pressure. Hold his arm up.
- I got it.</font>

772
01:27:54,427 --> 01:27:57,381
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yeah. Yeah, this is Officer Brian O'Conner.</font>

773
01:27:57,596 --> 01:28:00,052
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I'm off-duty MAPD.</font>

774
01:28:00,182 --> 01:28:02,970
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I need a life flight roll out right away.</font>

775
01:28:04,103 --> 01:28:08,397
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">My 20 is Highway 86, mile marker 147.</font>

776
01:28:08,941 --> 01:28:11,978
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I got one trauma victim,
about 24 years of age.</font>

777
01:28:12,069 --> 01:28:14,643
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Six-foot, maybe 200 pounds.</font>

778
01:28:14,822 --> 01:28:18,571
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">He's got a deep laceration to his right arm
with arterial bleeding.</font>

779
01:28:18,659 --> 01:28:23,037
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">And he's got a shotgun wound
close range to his left flank.</font>

780
01:28:24,957 --> 01:28:26,867
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Yeah, he's going into shock!</font>

781
01:30:06,935 --> 01:30:08,845
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Dom, put the gun down now!</font>

782
01:30:11,440 --> 01:30:13,267
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Move your car.
- No bullshit!</font>

783
01:30:13,358 --> 01:30:15,814
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Put it down now! No more running!</font>

784
01:30:15,944 --> 01:30:17,487
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I'm not running!</font>

785
01:30:20,616 --> 01:30:23,023
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Where's Leon and Letty?
- They're long gone!</font>

786
01:30:23,118 --> 01:30:26,155
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Then it's over.
I didn't call the police, but don't push me!</font>

787
01:30:26,246 --> 01:30:29,164
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Put the gun down. I swear to God!
- You are the cop!</font>

788
01:30:29,249 --> 01:30:30,660
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You're a cop!</font>

789
01:30:32,253 --> 01:30:35,622
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Brian, I got to find Jesse before they do.</font>

790
01:30:35,714 --> 01:30:38,585
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- I'm all the kid's got.
- I'll call in the plates.</font>

791
01:30:38,676 --> 01:30:42,376
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">PD will pick him up way before
Johnny even gets near him.</font>

792
01:30:42,555 --> 01:30:46,006
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">- Move your car.
- Dom, stop it! It's over. Please.</font>

793
01:30:46,142 --> 01:30:47,849
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Mia, stay out of it!</font>

794
01:30:53,399 --> 01:30:56,602
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Dominic, I am so sorry.</font>

795
01:30:56,986 --> 01:30:59,192
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I don't know what I'm doing, Dom.</font>

796
01:30:59,280 --> 01:31:03,527
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I'm so scared right now.
I don't know what's going on.</font>

797
01:31:03,617 --> 01:31:06,369
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">What were you thinking, man?</font>

798
01:31:06,454 --> 01:31:08,945
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I don't know! I panicked! I'm sorry.</font>

799
01:31:09,040 --> 01:31:10,949
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I'm scared!</font>

800
01:31:11,042 --> 01:31:14,126
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I don't know what I'm doing!
Will you please help me?</font>

801
01:31:18,674 --> 01:31:20,169
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Dom!</font>

802
01:31:39,028 --> 01:31:40,357
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Jesse!</font>

803
01:31:40,446 --> 01:31:41,941
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">No, Jesse!</font>

804
01:31:56,671 --> 01:31:58,296
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">No, Dom, no!</font>

805
01:34:53,182 --> 01:34:56,551
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">Call 911. You call 911!</font>

806
01:35:31,388 --> 01:35:34,139
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I used to drag here back in high school.</font>

807
01:35:34,849 --> 01:35:39,013
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">That railroad crossing up there
is exactly a quarter mile away from here.</font>

808
01:35:40,188 --> 01:35:42,810
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">On green, I'm going for it.</font>

809
01:38:17,388 --> 01:38:19,630
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">That's not what I had in mind.</font>

810
01:39:06,188 --> 01:39:08,097
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">You know what you're doing?</font>

811
01:39:08,565 --> 01:39:10,641
<font color="#c0c0c0" face="Perpetua">I owe you a 10-second car.</font>

